## Pruned entries (intentional removal, recorded for audit)

| Bibtex key | Reason for removal |
|-----------|-------------------|
| lambin2017 | Orphan — present in bib but not cited in any of the six manuscript .tex files. Pruned on 2026-05-26 because `zwanenburg2020` already covers the IBSI standard reference and `vangriethuysen2017` covers the PyRadiomics implementation reference; adding a third foundational radiomics review in the same sentence would not aid the reader. Source for future re-inclusion if needed: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28975929 (PMID 28975929, DOI 10.1038/nrclinonc.2017.141). |

